  "story": {
    "day": 130,
    "title": "Kaya's Cold Country Dream",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya wrote her own school report about a wild country.",
      "Her plan was a journey to travel and see the aurora.",
      "Brown Bear and wolves would appear there; she would camp safely.",
      "She knew to be careful because of the cold weather.",
      "Kaya visited her grandmother at the nursing home.",
      "She gave greetings and a little letter, sitting close.",
      "Her grandma did not bear a sad face.",
      "Later, Kaya went to a department store for coffee and a snack.",
      "Many shorts were on sale, a number of forty.",
      "Kaya laughed at the difference in winter culture, paying attention.",
      "An interviewer saw her join a new skate class.",
      "She did not forget her medicine; she sold old skates to avoid a break."
    ]
  }
